Implementation decisions:
- Reused dsc03.adapters.describe_pdf for real carrier inventory, scoped coverage,
  adapter manifest and pinned profile declarations. Added a pinned selector profile
  for page source locations, and checked all profile resolution in the new test.
- Kept native extraction separate from digitization.pipeline.run: the recorded path
  requires recognition configuration and stores recorded recognition observations;
  routing direct PDF extraction through it would conflate the two provenances.
- Native text evidence is `extracted` and transforms the adapter's observed page
  text; there are zero provider/OCR calls. inspect_run dispatches by mode to native
  integrity checks, and CLI inspection remains on the shared API.
- Scope is simple embedded text. Complex layout/Unicode, explicit partial coverage
  semantics and replay/repeatability remain for later children.
